L26_1 = "The power of the Nether God grows stronger as eternal slumber draws closer to Chifuyu. Every time Chifuyu\226\128\153s HP reaches 70%/ 40%/ 10%, she cancels all extra DMG and creates a twisted fate. Chifuyu obtains ATK +15% and gets granted extra abilities afterwards. (effect noncancellable) \n\n [Level 1 : Immunity to Hitstun from Special or lower skills]\n [Level 2 : Special skill\226\128\153s HIT reduction changes to Blindness instead]\n [Level 3 : Grants Skill Seal Immunity, and Skill Cooldown -30 s (Activates only once)]"
