Every 7 Basic Attacks with her enhanced broo... Elemental Weapon, casts an Enhanced attack. Hit enemies are inflicted with elemental effects that last for 4 seconds. Afterwards, Mi Rinae breaks her weapon and permanently gains ASPD +5% (Up to 6 stacks). Her elemental weapon is switched in order of Flame >Ice > Volt > Flame.

