The feast will complete the imperfect knowledge and perfect the imperfect beings.]]
L34_1[1] = L35_1
L34_1[2] = L36_1
L35_1 = {}
L36_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_PRYDWEN_1_2"
L37_1 = [[
He was a shadow of the Institution and always took care of the dirty work.
He never hesitated to get his hands bloodied.
He was never afraid to be lonely.
At some point, people started calling him "a man who stood on the verge of greatness."]]
L35_1[1] = L36_1
L35_1[2] = L37_1
L36_1 = {}
L37_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_PRYDWEN_INTERLUDE4"
L38_1 = [[
